From d896a7a7deb4e1deb139fad99abbcd2a1ab39d08 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 21:27:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] shell: undo and redo changes made in edit mode

Widgets and panels added or removed in edit mode, and widgets moved
there, could only be put back by hand. The shell now records these
changes, so Ctrl+Z and Ctrl+Shift+Z undo and redo them one by one.

BUG: 482150
